    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sites No 3: \r\nCirca 1.25 Acre Elevated Site with Full Planning permission.\r\n\r\n\r\nSinead Coughlan Estate Agent proudly presents a rare opportunity to secure a premium 1.25 acre site, ideally positioned in the charming setting of Loughill Village, just outside the well-known town of Foynes.\r\nThis exceptional site comes with full planning permission to build a 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom home, thoughtfully designed with modern open-plan living in mind — allowing you to step straight into building your dream home without delay.\r\nSet on an elevated position, the site enjoys stunning views over the Shannon Estuary, offering a peaceful countryside lifestyle with a truly scenic backdrop.\r\n\r\nLocated close to Foynes Port — a key hub of growth and investment — and with major infrastructure improvements enhancing connectivity to Adare Village and Limerick City, this location is only set to rise in demand. With Adare preparing to host the Ryder Cup, the wider area is attracting increasing attention, making this a smart investment as well as a lifestyle choice.\r\n\r\nThis is a turnkey site opportunity — all the groundwork is done, so you can focus on building the home you’ve always envisioned.\r\nFor more information call Sinead 087-4050663"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Generous 1.25 acre elevated site with Breathtaking views overlooking The Shannon Estuary.\r\nFull planning permission (will be in place in the coming weeks) for a 4 bedroom 3 bath Open Plan Dwelling\r\nNo occupancy clause, providing full flexibility for owner.\r\nThe Foynes to Limerick Road is a major 35km infrastructure project-designed to connect The Port of Foynes to Limerick City."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Foynes Village take the N69 to Loughill Village and take the L1229, sites on The Left across from The School."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Call Sinead for more information 087-4050663."
      }
    ],
